# Performance tooling. A raw Lighthouse report is ~540 kB and a five-run capture
# is 2.8 MB — and docs/13 asks for a fresh capture after every deploy, so
# committing them would grow the repo ~3 MB per measurement, forever. Run them
# through scripts/summarize-lhr.mjs instead: 2.8 MB -> 3 kB, per-run metrics
# retained. Only perf/baseline/<label>.json is committed.
.lighthouseci/
perf/lhci/
perf/lhci-desktop/
perf/cinematic/
perf/stats.html
perf/baseline/home-*.json

